 the signed form, not the list.", "t0": 36.82, "t1": 40.15, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Who received them is on the signed form, not on the public list."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.56, 0.65, 1.16, 1.33, 1.47, 1.57, 1.96, 2.43, 2.68, 2.81]}, {"scene": "war", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "links[2]"], "text": "War Memorial’s resident companies, SF Ballet and SF Symphony, gave its staff tickets too.", "t0": 40.37, "t1": 46.75, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["SF Ballet", "7 gifts, $3,150"], "b": ["SF Symphony", "8 gifts, $2,074"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.94, 1.42, 2.13, 2.41, 2.58, 3.07, 3.28, 3.51, 3.68, 4.67, 4.95, 5.09, 5.49, 5.96]}, {"scene": "war", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "Small gifts, 3,150 and 2,074 dollars.", "t0": 46.87, "t1": 52.68, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["SF Ballet", "7 gifts, $3,150"], "b": ["SF Symphony", "8 gifts, $2,074"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 1.15, 1.48, 1.99, 2.18, 2.48, 2.99, 3.21, 3.45, 3.9, 4.55]}, {"scene": "war", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "Also missing from the list.", "t0": 52.68, "t1": 54.38, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["SF Ballet", "7 gifts, $3,150"], "b": ["SF Symphony", "8 gifts, $2,074"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.54, 0.91, 1.1, 1.21]}, {"scene": "list", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[0]"], "text": "Why? The list keeps only the last filing of each month.", "t0": 54.6, "t1": 58.49, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the list keeps only the last filing of each month"}, "wt": [0.0, 1.15, 1.37, 1.67, 2.01, 2.28, 2.39, 2.72, 3.17, 3.28, 3.52]}, {"scene": "list", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "So an amendment that adds one gift erases the original’s donors from view.", "t0": 58.61, "t1": 63.08, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the list keeps only the last filing of each month"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.3, 0.8, 1.02, 1.38, 1.67, 2.04, 2.59, 2.72, 3.26, 3.77, 4.03]}, {"scene": "list", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[0]"], "text": "Across the City, 52 filings were replaced. None is on the list.", "t0": 63.2, "t1": 67.6, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "52", "label": "replaced filings", "sub": "none of them on the published list"}, "emph": ["52"], "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.62, 1.0, 1.61, 2.09, 2.27, 3.17, 3.49, 3.65, 3.79, 3.9]}, {"scene": "list", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "On 42 of them, 2.9 million dollars of gifts are on no filing the list holds.", "t0": 67.72, "t1": 73.35, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2.9 million", "label": "of gifts on no filing the list holds", "sub": "42 replaced filings, 494 gifts"}, "emph": ["2.9 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.79, 0.92, 1.15, 1.41, 1.72, 2.0, 2.35, 2.74, 2.86, 3.29, 3.55, 3.72, 3.98, 4.54, 4.67, 5.0]}, {"scene": "epic", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[2]", "story[4]", "timeline[0]"], "text": "One apparent loss was not a loss.", "t0": 73.57, "t1": 75.62, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Epic Systems Corporation, original filing", "4 gifts, $393,750"], "b": ["the amendment", "removed, pending the Board’s approval"], "kicker": "Public Health, February 2025"}, "emph": ["not a loss"], "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.67, 1.03, 1.23, 1.45, 1.52]}, {"scene": "epic", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[2]", "story[4]", "timeline[0]"], "text": "Public Health’s contractor Epic Systems gave 393,750 dollars.", "t0": 75.74, "t1": 82.32, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Epic Systems Corporation, original filing", "4 gifts, $393,750"], "b": ["the amendment", "removed, pending the Board’s approval"], "kicker": "Public Health, February 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.77, 1.53, 1.86, 2.48, 2.73, 3.02, 3.43, 4.06, 4.74, 5.16, 5.54, 5.91]}, {"scene": "epic", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[2]", "story[4]"], "text": "An amendment took those gifts off, because they still needed the Board’s approval.", "t0": 82.44, "t1": 86.38, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Epic Systems Corporation, original filing", "4 gifts, $393,750"], "b": ["the amendment", "removed, pending the Board’s approval"], "kicker": "Public Health, February 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.67, 0.9, 1.18, 1.55, 1.85, 2.12, 2.28, 2.57, 2.86, 2.96, 3.28]}, {"scene": "epic", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "timeline[1]"], "text": "The Board accepted them in May and June 2025. The list carries them.", "t0": 86.5, "t1": 91.3, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Accepted by the Board", "kicker": "Files 250359, 250360, 250544, 250545", "sub": "adopted 13 May 2025 and 10 June 2025", "chip": "now on the published list"}, "emph": ["The list carries them"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.4, 0.86, 1.03, 1.16, 1.38, 1.51, 1.86, 2.21, 3.47, 3.68, 4.02, 4.48]}, {"scene": "epic", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]", "links[5]"], "text": "Public Health has paid Epic’s public-sector company 57.2 million dollars since fiscal 2023.", "t0": 91.42, "t1": 98.26, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$57.2 million", "label": "Public Health to Epic State and Local Government, since fiscal 2023", "sub": "12 gifts from Epic on the list, $879,251"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.72, 0.89, 1.18, 1.59, 2.39, 2.9, 3.66, 3.95, 4.19, 4.57, 4.96, 5.26, 5.72, 6.08]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Not shown: that any gift bore on a contract, a renewal or a permit.", "t0": 98.48, "t1": 103.1, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any gift bore on a contract, a renewal or a permit", "That any gift was hidden", "Who received the festival tickets"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.92, 1.19, 1.45, 1.81, 2.13, 2.25, 2.33, 3.07, 3.22, 3.78, 3.98, 4.05]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Or that anything was hidden. Each gift is on the signed form.", "t0": 103.22, "t1": 106.73, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any gift bore on a contract, a renewal or a permit", "That any gift was hidden", "Who received the festival tickets"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.35, 0.75, 0.92, 1.61, 1.93, 2.28, 2.43, 2.55, 2.64, 3.03]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The Board resolutions accepting gifts over 10,000 dollars, and a corrected list.", "t0": 106.85, "t1": 113.58, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The Board resolutions accepting gifts of more than $10,000"}, {"who": "", "what": "A corrected public list that carries replaced filings"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.34, 0.71, 1.55, 1.75, 2.09, 2.93, 3.53, 3.94, 4.19, 4.46, 4.87, 5.39, 5.6, 5.68, 6.18]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "innocent[0]"], "text": "The departments disclosed these gifts. The gap is in the public copy.", "t0": 113.7, "t1": 118.16, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.73, 1.39, 1.66, 2.62, 2.82, 3.19, 3.34, 3.44, 3.53, 3.91]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 118.28, "t1": 120.59, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.46, 0.57, 0.64, 1.15, 1.36, 1.45]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "One gift form", "fest": "The festival permit", "war": "The resident companies", "list": "What the list keeps", "epic": "The contractor", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "person"}